 "strings": {
  "I think I'm gonna be shick...": "",
  "Draw me a bath of booze!\nI'll jump right in!": "",
  "I'm so dizzy... busy...\nfizzy... What was I sayin'?": "",
  "Somebody tell the road to\nstop moving around like that.": "",
  "I think I'm looost.\nWon't somebody help meee...?": "",
  "Drink, drink, drink!\nPiss, piss, piss!": "",
  "Sake and pickled eggplant—\na match made in heaven!": "",
  "Don't need nothin'\nif I got drinkin'!": "",
  "Sweet sake... The only thing\nthat'll never betray me...": "",
  "Drinks! Drinks! Drinks!\nOi! Oi! Oi!": "",
  "I'm gonna drink till I\ncan't drink a drop more!": "",
  "I have drunk thirty-four beers.": "",
  "I am *hic* abso-tively\nsober right now...": "",
  "I'm... sooo drunk...": "",
  "What's money for if\nnot to pay the boozeman?": "",
  "Don't drink your\nwhole week's pay, all right?": "",
  "Is the city spinnin'\nor is that me?": "",
  "Help me! I'm drunk\nand I'm huuungry!": "",
  "Think, uh... I mighta\nhad one too many...": "",
  "Ugh, I think I just\nhurled in the Kamo River...": "",
  "I don't... feel so good...\n*belch*": "",
  "Leeeeet's drink!": "",
  "I have not yet begun to drink!": "",
  "I need more booze,\nI'm still seein' straight...": "",
  "I drink and drink and drink\nand I'm still thirsty!": "",
  "Think I drank a\nwhole year's worth...": "",
  "Aaaaah!": "",
  "Oh shit, it's coming down!\nWatch out!": "",
  "Nothing but flames,\nfar as I can see!": "",
  "It's too late over there!": "",
  "Watch out!\nThat house is coming down!": "",
  "I can't run anymore...\nI'm too tired...": "",
  "Is our house okay!?": "",
  "Nooooo!": "",
  "Is this hell?": "",
  "It's too dangerous here!": "",
  "Who's going to\npay for all this!?": "",
  "This one's burning too!": "",
  "Never knew fires\ncould be so big...": "",
  "If we don't get out now,\nwe'll be trapped!": "",
  "This place is coming down too!": "",
  "That building is\ngoing to collapse!": "",
  "That way's blocked!\nNo getting through!": "",
  "Damn it all!": "",
  "Those houses are\nstarting to burn too!": "",
  "This city is no more.": "",
  "Whole street's an\ninferno over there!": "",
  "We have nowhere we can go!": "",
  "There's nowhere we can run!": "",
  "I've got to be dreaming...": "",
  "It's a great sea of fire,\neverywhere...": "",
  "This is unbelievable...": "",
  "How could this have happened?": "",
  "Forget it.\nWe're all dead anyway.": "",
  "*pant* *pant*": "",
  "Work with me here!": "",
  "Run! Don't stop running!": "",
  "We have to get out\nof here somehow!": "",
  "Hurry! Run! Run!": "",
  "Eek!": "",
  "It's gone up!": "",
  "There's still people inside!": "",
  "I hope everyone\nelse is all right...": "",
  "The place is already torched!": "",
  "It's all over...": "",
  "*pant* I can't run anymore...": "",
  "My house!": "",
  "Take my hand! Pull!": "",
  "What the hell happened!": "",
  "You go on ahead!": "",
  "All of it's going up in smoke...": "",
  "Please, help me!": "",
  "Mommy, I'm scared...": "",
  "Roof's comin' down!": "",
  "My home is gone...\nIt's just gone...": "",
  "The house is gone,\nyou need to save yourself now!": "",
  "Run! Drop everything and run!": "",
  "My lungs are killing me!": "",
  "Get outta here!": "",
  "This is a goddamn nightmare!": "",
  "Keep moving!": "",
  "Please, give me a hand here!": "",
  "Outta my way!": "",
  "Water, hurry!": "",
  "Bring water over here!": "",
  "There's no end to it.\nNothing we can do...": "",
  "Fire's not dying!": "",
  "The fire's just too strong...": "",
  "There's too much smoke!\nI can't breathe!": "",
  "This is the end of Kyo...": "",
  "Leave your things behind!": "",
  "Somebody, please! Help us!": "",
  "Heeelp!!!": "",
  "Someooone! Heeelp!": "",
  "We have to help them!": "",
  "Someone help us!": "",
  "My foot! It's stuck!": "",
  "The way's blocked...": "",
  "Here it is!": "",
  "Shit, I'm dead broke.": "",
  "Damn, I've never felt this\nway about a woman before...": "",
  "Shit, who stole my wallet!?": "",
  "Aw nuts, where'm I goin'?": "",
  "Think you could\nspot me some coin?": "",
  "Ah, crap...\nThink I overdid it...": "",
  "Steer clear of them.\nTake it from me.": "",
  "Why don't we head down the road?": "",
  "Was it that way?\nOr the other way?": "",
  "Haw haw haw!": "",
  "That was sexy as all get-out...": "",
  "Have at you, villain! Heh!": "",
  "Oh yeah, I know what you're\nin the market for, all right.": "",
  "Never seen nobody drink so much!": "",
  "This the place?": "",
  "I'm feelin' pretty lonely...": "",
  "Sounds good to me!": "",
  "Just a little bit, come on!": "",
  "Time to be getting home.": "",
  "Shouldn't we try\nsomeplace different?": "",
  "Back offa me, boy!": "",
  "Little something for papa?": "",
  "Looking's free, ain't it?": "",
  "Where was that place again?": "",
  "Where to?": "",
  "Hey you, come drink with us!": "",
  "Unbelievable!": "",
  "Aw, what the hell!?": "",
  "Whew!": "",
  "Catch you later.": "",
  "This is my favorite spot.": "",
  "My gut's 'bout to burst here!": "",
  "Why don't we settle\nthis over drinks?": "",
  "First and foremost, booze!": "",
  "Come back any time.": "",
  "I'm outta my depth!": "",
  "We could all die\ntomorrow anyway, let's drink!": "",
  "Ugh, what's my address again?": "",
  "Oof, couldn't eat\nanother bite...": "",
  "Forget it, kid!": "",
  "I was a real looker\nin my day, y'know!": "",
  "Hm? Is this the place?": "",
  "Hm? Didn't we just pass it?": "",
  "Don't be a stranger.": "",
  "We'll check the\nplace out next time.": "",
  "Tonight's my treat!\nDrink all you like!": "",
  "I think you've\nhad enough, buddy.": "",
  "It's payday,\nlet's have some fun!": "",
  "Got what I needed,\nI'm heading home.": "",
  "The chef at that place\nknows what he's doing.": "",
  "That's rough, no doubt about it.": "",
  "That ain't good...": "",
  "Sake! Sake! Sake!": "",
  "Wife's gonna tan my hide...": "",
  "I'm gonna miss you lot!": "",
  "C'mon, just a little...": "",
  "Keep your head low, boy!": "",
  "How about a little\nrest and relaxation?": "",
  "Care for a drink?": "",
  "I ain't some old has-been!": "",
  "I miss her already!": "",
  "Don't tell me you fell for her?": "",
  "I think I'm in love!": "",
  "I'm not above\na night of pleasure...": "",
  "Ain't she cute as a button?": "",
  "Could go for a tasty meal.": "",
  "I'll treat you to\nsomethin' good, pal!": "",
  "They got some damn\ntasty booze at that joint.": "",
  "Damn, that was good!": "",
  "Now that's a laugh!": "",
  "I'm havin' fun!": "",
  "Where to next? I'm flying high!": "",
  "Let's get wild!": "",
  "Yer makin' me blush, doll!": "",
  "I'm not about to lose\nto some young'n!": "",
  "I find myself taken\nby an unquenchable thirst...": "",
  "I'm feelin' good already!": "",
  "Oof, I'm drunk...": "",
  "I'm flushed with cash!": "",
  "Hold up, I need\nsomething to eat first.": "",
  "I think I had too much...": "",
  "Heh heh, worth every mon!": "",
  "Aw crap,\nI left my wallet at home!": "",
  "How many times do\nI have to tell you no?": "",
  "Crap, is that the time?\nI need to go!": "",
  "If you're smart,\nyou'll avoid that area...": "",
  "Let's try that street!": "",
  "Hahahaha! My sides're splittin'!": "",
  "All right, but you\nowe me one, got it?": "",
  "Let's meet up later, yeah?": "",
  "Hahaha! That's hilarious!": "",
  "I'm gonna eat the whole thing!": "",
  "It's not always about you, okay?": "",
  "Okay, here goes!": "",
  "There's no need to be rude.": "",
  "Man, I'd love to have a\nshop of my own here someday!": "",
  "One day, I'm gonna march\nin there and buy it!": "",
  "It's always like this...": "",
  "That's awful!": "",
  "I'm so sorry to hear that!": "",
  "I'd love to live\nin a house like that!": "",
  "Sure, I'm in!": "",
  "How much does it cost\nto live around here?": "",
  "All right, count me in too!": "",
  "Gimme a bite of yours!": "",
  "Maybe I'll get one too!": "",
  "That sounds great!": "",
  "Come on,\nscrew your head on straight!": "",
  "Aw, come on! Cut me a break!": "",
  "That's enough outta you!": "",
  "Great weather this week!": "",
  "Don't worry, I know a good spot!": "",
  "Wow, what an amazing view!": "",
  "Ah! Nice bath!": "",
  "Mmm, I needed that bath!": "",
  "Ahhh, that's a hell of a bath!": "",
  "This is just no good!\nNo good at all!": "",
  "Wow, what a\nmagnificent building!": "",
  "Did you see that guy just now?\nHe was beautiful!": "",
  "That can't be true, can it?": "",
  "Thank you very much!": "",
  "Appreciate it!": "",
  "Pleasure doing\nbusiness with you!": "",
  "My tummy's rumbling\nsomething fierce!": "",
  "Wonder where we can go\nto have some fun around here.": "",
  "That's hilarious!": "",
  "Eh, wasn't as funny this time...": "",
  "You don't really mean that...": "",
  "You can't be serious!": "",
  "I'm so sick of\nhearing you gloat!": "",
  "Life is a nightmare.": "",
  "Would love a cup of tea\nright about now...": "",
  "I could go for some tea,\ncouldn't you?": "",
  "Keep this just between\nyou and me, okay?": "",
  "Let's stop here and rest.": "",
  "This seems like a\ngood spot for a break.": "",
  "This is it! This is the place!": "",
  "There's more to this story,\nI'm sure of it!": "",
  "I must've dropped it\nsomewhere around here...": "",
  "Hmm... Wasn't it supposed\nto be around here?": "",
  "Wait, didn't we already\ncome this way?": "",
  "Can't you do\nsomething about this?": "",
  "I picked this up\nfor a song recently.": "",
  "Help me out and\nbuy this, friend!": "",
  "Ah, pardon me!": "",
  "Excuse me, sir!": "",
  "Dang, Kyo sure is big, ain't it?": "",
  "What, you want to go\nback to the last place?": "",
  "Pick up the pace, kid!": "",
  "Mm, I feel refreshed!": "",
  "If you're good, we'll go\nthere on the way back.": ""
